==Strategy==
[[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] is quite helpful as he can block Mr. Mer's waves and has resistance against Cli-One. However, don't forget about the peons, and always pay attention to how much money you have. [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]] can be very useful for dealing with the Zrocos. Also bring something for the clean up phase, such as [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] that can take out Cli-One quickly, as it can be nearly impossible to win once the Aku Doges start pouring out.

